{"ticker":{"symbol":"049080.KQ","name":"기가레인","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":5640.0,"change_pct":-0.05210084033613449,"market_cap":47815790592.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":31250.0,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Semiconductor Equipment & Materials","country":"South Korea","city":"Hwaseong-si","employees":189,"website":"https://www.gigalane.com","business_summary":"GIGALANE Co.,Ltd. manufactures and sells radio frequency (RF) communication components and semiconductor equipment in South Korea and internationally. It offers connector, adapter, cable, mobile coax plugs and jack, board to board connector, end-launch connector, and cal-kit, as well as cable designer. The company also provides ICP, DRIE, CCP, LED etcher, and nano imprinter. In addition, it provides mobile and wireless devices, 5G network infrastructure, test and measurement, and defense and aerospace; and silicon-based semiconductor, computer semiconductor, MEMS, and micro and nano patterning solutions. The company was founded in 2000 and is headquartered in Hwaseong-si, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"(주)기가레인 한국 및 해외에서 무선 주파수(RF) 통신 부품 및 반도체 장비를 제조 및 판매하고 있습니다. 커넥터, 어댑터, 케이블, 모바일 동축 플러그 및 잭, 보드-보드 커넥터, 엔드 론치 커넥터 및 교정 키트는 물론 케이블 디자이너도 제공합니다. 이 밖에도 ICP, DRIE, CCP, LED etcher, nano imprinter 등도 공급하고 있다. 또한 모바일 및 무선 장치, 5G 네트워크 인프라, 테스트 및 측정, 방위 및 항공우주를 제공합니다. 실리콘 기반 반도체, 컴퓨터 반도체, MEMS, 마이크로 및 나노 패터닝 솔루션 등이 있습니다. 2000년에 설립되었으며 본사는 대한민국 화성에 위치하고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"반도체 장비·소재","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":54726444530.0,"operating_income":-7101224350.0,"net_income":-8319575710.0,"eps":-1050.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":44294520240.0,"operating_income":-11774176800.0,"net_income":-11237353420.0,"eps":-1320.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":4168